WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.050
Things moving brokers said to me this week.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.247
Them: Thank goodness I got you, and not your husband.

00:00:09.247 --> 00:00:11.300
Them: He'd ask too many questions.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.050
Ask every question.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.775
Them: Nobody does that.

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:19.234
Real movers do.

00:00:19.234 --> 00:00:20.200
Mine did.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.729
Them: Scroll to the bottom.

00:00:22.729 --> 00:00:23.576
Them: Sign here.

00:00:23.576 --> 00:00:25.100
Them: Now the next page.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:28.000
Read every page first.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.500
Them: I'll wait on hold while you read.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:33.775
Hang up.

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.793
Real businesses don't need these lines.

00:00:37.793 --> 00:00:39.238
Packed Rabbit dot com.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:42.327
A moving app made by a consumer, for consumers.

00:00:42.327 --> 00:00:47.255
If this helped, like it, share it with someone who's moving, and subscribe.
